  "description": "The V-19 Torrent starfighter, also known as the V-19 Torrent Interceptor, was a model of starfighter manufactured by Slayn & Korpil. They were used by the Republic Navy during the Clone Wars, predominantly during the early stages of the war, participating in campaigns such as the Battle of Christophsis, the Malevolence Campaign, the Battle of Ryloth, the Battle of Kamino, and the Battle of Sullust. It was eventually succeeded by the Alpha-3 Nimbus-class V-wing starfighter.",
